        "text_AXtkTV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Become a part of the Annie’s Pooch Pops family by joining our top paying Affiliate Program.\n\n        Our goal at Annie’s Pooch Pops is to become the premier and highest paying partner in the dog treat market. Annie’s Pooch Pops handmakes all-natural dog treats in a human-grade bakery using ingredients sourced entirely in the USA.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n        Our attractive packaging and pooch-pleasing treats are sure to attract your followers. And, with our <strong>90-day cookie policy</strong>, those customers will come back when their pooches beg for more!\n    </p>\n    \n   <strong>Setup is Easy</strong>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Sign up and join our affiliate program powered by ShareASale</li>\n        <li>Once your application is approved you’ll have access to our creative and text links</li>\n        <li>Access our exclusive affiliate promotions</li>\n        <li>Track your referrals online through ShareASale</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n        Once you have joined the program, reach out to our affiliate manager to share your campaign strategies, get tips on how to optimize your current campaign, and learn more about current incentive programs.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n        Visit: <a href=\"http://www.shareasale.com/join/AnniesPoochPops\" style=\"color: #444249; text-decoration: none;\">http://www.shareasale.com/join/AnniesPoochPops</a>\n    </p>",
