        "heading_size": 36,
        "heading_color": "#444249",
        "description": "Matt McInerney, the current owner of Annie’s Pooch Pops, named his childhood dog 'Annie' in homage to Little Orphan Annie. Annie was a rescued golden retriever/corgi mix with a strawberry-blonde coat. Matt and Annie were inseparable and truly embodied the phrase of man’s best friend. Acquiring the Annie’s Pooch Pops business was the perfect opportunity for Matt to honor the legacy of a revered family member.",
